abstract: >-
  Closed-form formula for IE(Z, N) of any atom or ion: exact first-order screening constants plus a bounded fitted
  remainder (33 global parameters), validated on all 5847 NIST ASD v5.12 successive ionization energies.
  Project folder: Np/.
